1
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:31,079
I... I promise you

2
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,640
Tomorrow

3
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:34,280
Tomorrow

4
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:40,560
I'll go to work

5
00:02:02,879 --> 00:02:03,920
Those animals.

6
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:06,560
I'm calling the police right now.

7
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,760
You can't call the police.

8
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:08,879
Why not?

9
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:11,080
Elephant's place is the biggest

10
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,879
entertainment complex around here.

11
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,240
The cops raid that place

12
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:16,120
every couple of days.

13
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,680
But they've never found

14
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,120
the evidence to take them down for good.

15
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,400
That's because inside the police force

16
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,520
they've got a mole.

17
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:22,879
If we call the police now,

18
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,680
it's the same as tipping them off.

19
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,639
So what do we do?

20
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,319
If they move my sister,

21
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:28,560
she'll be even harder to find.

22
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:30,240
Calm down. What they want is money.

23
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,080
I'll go talk to Elephant.

24
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,000
I'm coming too.

25
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:33,639
No way.

26
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,199
Sit your ass down.

27
00:02:38,879 --> 00:02:39,800
You're not going anywhere.

28
00:02:40,159 --> 00:02:41,439
What if something goes wrong?

29
00:02:43,759 --> 00:02:44,560
It won't.

30
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:47,000
The nightclub's under the United Righteous Group.

31
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,759
Ah Hong and I are still on speaking terms.

32
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:51,360
Elephant will do me this favor.

33
00:02:52,039 --> 00:02:54,680
But back at the nightclub,

34
00:02:54,879 --> 00:02:56,560
we already made enemies with them.

35
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:00,639
But we've got to save her.

36
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:08,400
Here's what we'll do.

37
00:03:09,199 --> 00:03:10,280
Just in case,

38
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,280
I'll still go find Officer Chen

39
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,520
and fill him in.

40
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,319
You lost again.

41
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:28,199
Where's my sister? Where'd you hide her?

42
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,159
What are you yelling about?

43
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,000
Well, if it isn't Brother Qiang.

44
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,719
Brother Qiang, we're all family here.

45
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,840
We can talk things through.

46
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,280
So many people are watching.

47
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,400
Let's step aside and talk.

48
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,159
We'll talk right here.

49
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,560
Brother Qiang.

50
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,719
Long time no see.

51
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:55,599
What brings you here today?

52
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,039
We're here to find someone.

53
00:03:58,039 --> 00:03:59,000
I get it.

54
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,240
Everyone who comes here is looking for someone.

55
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:03,719
So, kid, what type are you into?

56
00:04:07,639 --> 00:04:08,639
We're looking for A Fen.

57
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:09,680
A Fen?

58
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:12,319
Do we even have anyone by that name?

59
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:14,639
Anyone know an A Fen?

60
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:16,439
Never heard of her.

61
00:04:18,879 --> 00:04:20,600
The guest has already placed his order.

62
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,759
Go on, hurry up and find her.

63
00:04:22,199 --> 00:04:23,199
Got it, boss.

64
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:37,120
All the A Fens are right here.

65
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:39,199
So, kid, which one do you want?

66
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,439
Let me introduce them.

67
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,399
This one here,

68
00:04:43,399 --> 00:04:44,839
the A Fen from Tung Choi Street.

69
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,600
This local A Fen,

70
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,759
born and raised here,

71
00:04:47,879 --> 00:04:49,920
runs the most famous one-woman brothel in West Kowloon.

72
00:04:50,319 --> 00:04:51,519
Now this one's really something.

73
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,639
This one here,

74
00:04:53,639 --> 00:04:55,639
our big-venue A Fen,

75
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:57,680
absolutely the top girl on Portland Street.

76
00:04:58,439 --> 00:05:00,480
I've had this A Fen myself.

77
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:02,319
Really top-notch.

78
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:03,439
What the hell are you talking about?

79
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:05,319
Hand over my sister, now!

80
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,680
Oh, you mean that A Fen.

81
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,879
But,

82
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,800
that A Fen,

83
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,800
she comes at a very steep price.

84
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:22,120
Go on up.

85
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:22,639
Sis.

86
00:05:23,759 --> 00:05:24,439
Sis.

87
00:05:25,839 --> 00:05:26,879
Why are you here?

88
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,120
Didn't you already leave?

89
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:28,560
Sis,

90
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,879
I came with Brother Qiang.

91
00:05:29,879 --> 00:05:31,040
Let's go home, okay?

92
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:32,600
Brother Qiang, huh?

93
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:34,120
Just... stay out of my business.

94
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:35,399
Take my brother away.

95
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,480
Take my brother out of here.

96
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,199
This A Fen,

97
00:05:38,399 --> 00:05:40,040
she's really pricey.

98
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:43,879
It costs a million to book her out.

99
00:05:43,879 --> 00:05:45,160
We don't owe that much.

100
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:46,399
That's loan-sharking.

101
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:46,959
You're just shaking us down.

102
00:05:46,959 --> 00:05:47,480
Xiao Qi.

103
00:05:49,959 --> 00:05:51,120
Xiao Qi.

104
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:51,800
Listen to me.

105
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,600
Listen to your sister.

106
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:54,040
I'm willing to stay here.

107
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,279
Really, just go, okay?

108
00:05:55,279 --> 00:05:56,480
Let me handle this myself.

109
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,360
Sis,

110
00:05:58,279 --> 00:05:59,360
you can't stay here.

111
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,160
Why can't I stay here?

112
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:03,720
I'm doing just fine here.

113
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,879
They all treat me well.

114
00:06:04,879 --> 00:06:06,199
Can't you see that?

115
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,360
And besides,

116
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:09,839
and you,

117
00:06:10,399 --> 00:06:12,120
you think you can take me away?

118
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,959
How are you supposed to take me away?

119
00:06:15,079 --> 00:06:15,560
If I leave,

120
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,600
what happens to Dad?

121
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,279
Do you want me to watch

122
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:19,920
our father die with my own eyes?

123
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,000
Sis,

124
00:06:31,439 --> 00:06:33,120
why didn't you tell me?

125
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:36,079
Xiao Qi, Xiao Qi.

126
00:06:36,399 --> 00:06:37,720
Xiao Qi, listen to me.

127
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,720
Listen to your sister.

128
00:06:38,879 --> 00:06:39,600
I...

129
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:42,639
I have no other choice left.

130
00:06:42,639 --> 00:06:43,399
But you're different.

131
00:06:43,399 --> 00:06:45,120
Xiao Qi, you're still young.

132
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:47,079
You're still a kid, you have plenty of chances.

133
00:06:47,079 --> 00:06:48,040
You leave first, okay?

134
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,079
I'm begging you.

135
00:06:49,079 --> 00:06:50,639
You leave first, okay?

136
00:06:50,639 --> 00:06:52,839
Xiao Qi, I'm begging you.

137
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,600
Sis.

138
00:06:56,279 --> 00:06:59,240
Why won't you just listen?

139
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:03,600
Such devoted siblings, aren't you.

140
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:07,120
She's already said she's happy here.

141
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:10,480
So don't go pushing her into anything.

142
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,920
Elephant.

143
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,879
Here's two thousand for you.

144
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,360
Brother Qiang

145
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,240
That flower shop business last time,

146
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,000
I already showed you plenty of respect.

147
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,199
You wanted me to make amends,

148
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,720
you wanted me to apologize,

149
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,439
and I did all of it.

150
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:56,360
Today, this is not up for discussion.

151
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:58,560
Brother Hong said it too.

152
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:01,160
You owe a debt, you pay it back.

153
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:03,319
That's only fair.

154
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,480
What's more,

155
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:08,079
you promised Brother Hong

156
00:08:08,199 --> 00:08:10,680
you'd stay out of our affairs.

157
00:08:13,199 --> 00:08:14,000
Brother Qiang,

158
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:16,040
you've got to understand,

159
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:18,519
this thing called face,

160
00:08:18,519 --> 00:08:22,199
it doesn't always work, you know.

161
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:23,560
Xiao Qi.

162
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:26,920
You're really pushing it too far, aren't you?

163
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,759
Brother Qiang, now that's just wrong of you.

164
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,440
This is my money,

165
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:42,480
and it's Brother Hong's money too.

166
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,080
If you take these people away,

167
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:46,159
how do I answer to the higher-ups?

168
00:08:46,679 --> 00:08:47,879
I'm taking them, and that's final.

169
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,159
Get Xie Guanhong.

170
00:08:49,159 --> 00:08:50,240
Tell him to come see me now.

171
00:08:50,519 --> 00:08:52,120
We call you Brother Qiang,

172
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,879
and you actually think you're somebody?

173
00:08:54,039 --> 00:08:55,960
You're just a lousy flower seller.

174
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,720
Who dares lay a hand on Brother Qiang?

175
00:08:58,799 --> 00:09:01,480
Brother Qiang.

176
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:02,720
What is it?

177
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,519
Brother Qiang,

178
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:09,120
what a big show,

179
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,600
bringing this many men.

180
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,519
Brother Qiang,

181
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:15,080
you're not trying to rally the troops, are you?

182
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:18,600
You really want to be the Dragon Head of Heyisheng?

183
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,240
Three Dots.

184
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,639
Uncle Fat.

185
00:09:27,399 --> 00:09:28,080
What's up?

186
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,240
Why so flustered?

187
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,039
Just now,

188
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,840
Liang Zhiqiang rallied the troops.

189
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,679
Pass.

190
00:09:45,279 --> 00:09:46,559
Well, well, well.

191
00:09:47,519 --> 00:09:50,159
A pheasant turning into a phoenix.

192
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,639
Chow.

193
00:10:08,879 --> 00:10:09,480
Brother Hong

194
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,360
Liang Zhiqiang's rallying the troops

195
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,919
He led his men to trash the nightclub

196
00:10:12,919 --> 00:10:14,240
He's turning against you!

197
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,360
You, Elephant, who the hell are you?

198
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:33,639
You're nothing but Xie Guanhong's dog.

199
00:10:33,759 --> 00:10:34,759
A lackey.

200
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,039
What did you say?

201
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:37,279
You used to be nothing

202
00:10:37,279 --> 00:10:38,639
but Cannon's dog.

203
00:10:38,639 --> 00:10:40,080
Now you got a new master and you're barking again.

204
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,840
You bunch of rabid dogs.

205
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:43,919
You do whatever Xie Guanhong tells you.

206
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,720
No loyalty, no morals.

207
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,360
Sooner or later you'll be hacked to death.

208
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,159
Heaven will strike you down.

209
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,759
Hacked to death?

210
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,480
I'll stab you to death first.

211
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:52,720
You bunch of traitors.

212
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,399
Rallying the troops for Liang Zhiqiang.

213
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:56,039
Faking all this loyalty crap.

214
00:10:56,279 --> 00:10:58,480
You're the filthiest animals

215
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,679
in all of Heyisheng.

216
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:01,440
Cheating people out of money and lives.

217
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:03,000
You even sell people off.

218
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:04,519
It's 2018.

219
00:11:04,679 --> 00:11:06,440
Even the rule of law can't save you scum.

220
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,399
May your whole family drop dead.

221
00:11:07,399 --> 00:11:08,840
I've hated your guts for a long time.

222
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:09,919
Hold on.

223
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:11,159
I'll blow your damn head off first.

224
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:12,000
Come on!

225
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,559
Come on!

226
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,080
Freeze!

227
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:19,159
Police!

228
00:11:19,159 --> 00:11:20,159
Don't move! Drop your weapons!

229
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:20,720
Get down!

230
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:21,519
Put down the knife!
